class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/alhambra"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Alhambra.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Alhambra</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Alhambra and Generalife are listed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/hong-kong"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hong%20Kong.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hong Kong</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sino-British Joint Declaration provides for the handover of Hong Kong to China</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/st-peters-basilica"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/St.%20Peter's%20Basilica.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>St. Peter's Basilica</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Vatican City was inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/mosque-cathedral-of-cordoba"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mosque%E2%80%93Cathedral%20of%20C%C3%B3rdoba.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mosque–Cathedral of Córdoba</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Mosque–Cathedral was declared a UNESCO World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/statue-of-liberty"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Statue%20of%20Liberty.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Statue of Liberty</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The statue was designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/golden-temple"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Golden%20Temple.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Golden Temple</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Indian Army carried out Operation Blue Star in the complex between 1 and 8 June, and the Akal Takht was destroyed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/neoliberalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Neoliberalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Neoliberalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">David Lange appoints Roger Douglas finance minister in New Zealand, beginning the reforms known as Rogernomics</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/ahmadiyya"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ahmadiyya.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ahmadiyya</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After Pakistan issues Ordinance XX, the fourth Caliph relocates to London</span></li></ul></section>
